(If you are a Caveman): Since they start peaceful, you have time to
dig a pit before you fight them.  Then you stand behind the pit while
slinging flintstones at them, while leading them into the pit.  After
they fall into the pit, move away from them, and then sling more
flintstones at them.  If you don't think that is enough, then you can
also gather a giant stack of rocks, and make a couple of emergency
Elbereth squares before you fight them.

And if you are really against using Elbereth, then you can find a
beartrap, and set that in the same area as the pit.  Then you can
sling flintstones while you lead them into the pit, move away, then
sling more flintstones while you lead them into the bear trap, move
away, then sling more stuff at them.

(Personally, I would get at least skilled in slings before trying any
of this, for the to-hit bonus)


